hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2890","###\n Narrated to us Abdullah bin Saeed Al-Ashaj, who narrated to us Hafsh bin Ghiyath, from Ja'far, from his father, from Jabir (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) slaughtered (his sacrificial animals) at Mina. He (ﷺ) said: \All of Mina is a place for slaughtering.\""\n\nAbu Bakr (the commentator) said: This phrase"," \""All of Mina is a place for slaughtering","\"" belongs to the category of evidence"""
